Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Quests for Blackmaw Hold, a Forever dungeon in northern Azshara \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 55-60 Blackmaw Hold]
[NX 55-60 Dire Maul East]

The entrance is the old furbolg gate in northern Azshara, west of the road to Ursolan. Behind the gate a long tunnel runs into the mountain; the portal is at its far end, below Darkwhisper Gorge. The Azshara quests need level 45 to 55; Blackmaw Magic needs level 52.

-- Left out: 92065 Blackmaw Reclamation (Gatekeeper Rageroar, Ursolan): it needs a six-quest chain first (Korsa at Legashi Stronghold, Gorn One Eye in Timbermaw Hold, the elite Prince Halanox) and, by player reports quoted in Dungeon Journal (Data/QuestUpdates.lua, 92065 note), Timbermaw Hold Friendly; unconfirmed. That chain is an Azshara zone chain, not a dungeon errand.
-- Left out: 96246 Blackmaw Pouches (repeatable follow-up of 97327 at Ekkal, for Timbermaw reputation only).
-- Left out: 92067 Feeding Time! (repeatable; no source knows its giver yet).

-- Horde pickups: Orgrimmar, Ashenvale to Valormok, Thunder Bluff and Mulgore, then back to Azshara.
[A Horde] In Orgrimmar, at Doras, get the Orgrimmar flight path [P Orgrimmar] [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar]
[A Horde] Fly to Splintertree Post if you know the flight path [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar] \\ No flight tag: the library-book guides teach it as an optional stop. Without it, walk the next steps.
[A Horde] Only without the Splintertree flight path: Orgrimmar gate, Durotar road and the Southfury bridge [G45.5,12.0 Durotar][G45.5,25.7 Durotar][G34.5,42.5 Durotar][G61.8,20.0 The Barrens] [OC]
[A Horde] Only without it: west, then north to Mor'shan and up the ramp into Ashenvale [G51.0,20.0 The Barrens][G50.5,14.5 The Barrens][G49.0,10.0 The Barrens][G48.0,6.0 The Barrens][G68.0,86.0 Ashenvale][G73.3,61.7 Ashenvale] [OC]
[A Horde] From Splintertree Post, east through the Ashenvale forest toward Azshara [G75.6,59.6 Ashenvale][G78.6,55.6 Ashenvale][G81.8,52.7 Ashenvale][G87.0,49.3 Ashenvale][G90.0,46.9 Ashenvale][G94.5,46.7 Ashenvale][G95.7,48.7 Ashenvale][G98.5,49.0 Ashenvale] [OC] \\ Night elf and satyr camps lie east of the post; keep to the open ground. Emeraldon Boughguards and Oracles (elite, level 61-62) stand near the border at 95,40; stay south of them.
[A Horde] Over the border and north-east up to Valormok [G13.9,75.5 Azshara][G14.6,68.4 Azshara][G16.6,61.3 Azshara][G19.0,54.2 Azshara][G22.0,49.6 Azshara] [OC]
[A Horde] At Kroum, get the Valormok flight path [P Valormok] [G22.0,49.6 Azshara]
[A Horde] Jediga, beside the flight master, gives [QA92346 Beneath Nordrassil] [G22.6,51.4 Azshara]
[A Horde] Fly to Thunder Bluff from Kroum [G22.0,49.6 Azshara] \\ Uses the Thunder Bluff flight path from earlier guides (Tauren start with it), so no flight tag here. If you lack it, fly to Orgrimmar [F Orgrimmar] and walk the next steps.
[A Horde] Only without the Thunder Bluff flight path: from Orgrimmar, out the Orgrimmar gate and down the Durotar road to the Southfury bridge [G45.5,12.0 Durotar][G45.5,25.7 Durotar][G34.5,42.5 Durotar] [OC]
[A Horde] Only without it: over the bridge and west past the Crossroads to the Mulgore pass [G61.8,20.0 The Barrens][G51.0,20.0 The Barrens][G52.0,30.0 The Barrens][G43.0,31.0 The Barrens][G35.5,27.5 The Barrens] [OC]
[A Horde] Only without it: over the ridge into Mulgore and on to the Thunder Bluff lift [G49.9,15.0 Mulgore][G42.1,24.9 Mulgore][G39.0,33.1 Mulgore] [OC]
[A Horde] At Tal, get the Thunder Bluff flight path [P Thunder Bluff] [G47.0,49.8 Thunder Bluff]
[A Horde] On Elder Rise, Nara Wildmane takes [QT92346 Beneath Nordrassil] and gives [QA92343 Get to the Roots of It] [G75.7,31.6 Thunder Bluff]
[A Horde] Take the north lift down and cross the plains to the Skywatcher Plateau [G39.0,33.1 Mulgore][G40.0,25.0 Mulgore][G35.0,22.5 Mulgore] [OC] \\ Enforcer Emilgund (elite) may roam the plains.
[A Horde] Muln Earthfury gives [QA97198 Blackmaw Magic] [G33.4,22.6 Mulgore] \\ Needs level 52.
[A Horde] Back to the lift and up to Tal [G35.0,22.5 Mulgore][G40.0,25.0 Mulgore][G39.0,33.1 Mulgore] [OC]
[A Horde] At Tal, fly to Valormok [F Valormok] [G47.0,49.8 Thunder Bluff]
[A Horde] East along the road to the Ruins of Eldarath [G22.6,51.4 Azshara][G32.1,51.4 Azshara][G41.5,39.6 Azshara] [OC] \\ Spitelash naga, hippogryphs and Blackmaw furbolgs (level 46-52) line the road; Cliff Walkers (elite, 52-53) roam the hills north of it.

-- Alliance pickups: an optional Dalaran trip, then Auberdine, Ashenvale and Azshara, with a stop in Darnassus.
[A Alliance] Optional, level 52 and up: the Dalaran trip for Blackmaw Magic. Archmage Timear gives it and takes it back, so it costs two visits; skip this block and its turn-in block and you lose nothing else.
[A Alliance] Optional: get to Southshore the way you know (a flight, or the Menethil Harbor boat), and at Darla Harris get the Southshore flight path [P Southshore] [G49.4,52.1 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[A Alliance] Optional: north-west across the hills toward Alterac [G40.9,33.7 Hillsbrad Foothills][G32.9,15.0 Hillsbrad Foothills] [OC] \\ Yetis (level 30-32) sit in the caves to the west.
[A Alliance] Optional: up to Dalaran by the south gate [G22.5,82.0 Alterac Mountains][G18.2,76.9 Alterac Mountains] [OC] \\ An elite Arcane Sentry (level 55) may stand by the road.
[A Alliance] Optional: Archmage Timear, outside where the Violet Hold stood, gives [QA97173 Blackmaw Magic] [G15.4,74.1 Alterac Mountains] \\ QuestieDB flags him (elite 55) as hostile, as in the earlier Dalaran guides; check before you pull.
[A Alliance] Optional: back down to Southshore and walk onto the pier [G18.2,76.9 Alterac Mountains][G22.5,82.0 Alterac Mountains][G32.9,15.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G40.9,33.7 Hillsbrad Foothills][G50.0,58.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G50.7,70.4 Hillsbrad Foothills] [OC]
[A Alliance] Optional: take the boat to Auberdine [G50.7,70.4 Hillsbrad Foothills] \\ QuestieDB marks a Southshore Defender (level 55) hostile in town; check before you pull. Stay on board until Auberdine.
[A Alliance] In Auberdine, at Caylais Moonfeather, get the Auberdine flight path [P Auberdine] [G36.4,45.6 Darkshore] \\ Get to Auberdine the way you know if you skipped Dalaran: the Stormwind boat or a flight.
[A Alliance] Fly to Astranaar if you know the flight path [G36.4,45.6 Darkshore] \\ No flight tag: the library-book guides teach it as an optional stop. Without it, walk the next steps.
[A Alliance] Only without the Astranaar flight path: south along the Darkshore road into Ashenvale [G37.0,44.0 Darkshore][G41.0,40.0 Darkshore][G44.0,58.0 Darkshore][G38.0,68.0 Darkshore][G37.5,80.0 Darkshore][G43.0,92.0 Darkshore][G28.0,14.0 Ashenvale] [OC]
[A Alliance] Only without it: south past Maestra's Post to Astranaar [G27.0,36.0 Ashenvale][G34.5,48.0 Ashenvale] [OC]
[A Alliance] At Daelyshia, get the Astranaar flight path [P Astranaar] [G34.5,48.0 Ashenvale]
[A Alliance] East out of Astranaar along the Ashenvale road [G36.6,52.6 Ashenvale][G37.9,55.0 Ashenvale][G41.0,52.0 Ashenvale][G41.0,49.0 Ashenvale][G49.0,48.4 Ashenvale][G57.4,48.4 Ashenvale][G65.7,48.8 Ashenvale] [OC] \\ Satyrs and furbolgs camp near the road; Splintertree Post (Horde) is to the south-east. Emeraldon Boughguards and Oracles (elite, level 61-62) stand north of the road near the border at 95,40.
[A Alliance] Keep east to the Azshara border [G74.0,48.8 Ashenvale][G74.0,40.0 Ashenvale][G80.0,40.0 Ashenvale][G82.3,48.6 Ashenvale][G90.0,46.9 Ashenvale][G94.5,46.7 Ashenvale][G95.7,48.7 Ashenvale][G98.5,49.0 Ashenvale] [OC]
[A Alliance] At Jarrodenus, get the Talrendis Point flight path [P Talrendis Point] [G11.9,77.6 Azshara]
[A Alliance] Commander Truesong gives [QA92345 Beneath Nordrassil] [G11.8,78.4 Azshara]
[A Alliance] Back to Jarrodenus and fly to Auberdine [F Auberdine] [G11.9,77.6 Azshara]
[A Alliance] Walk west through Auberdine onto the piers [G37.0,44.0 Darkshore][G32.7,41.9 Darkshore]
[A Alliance] Take the boat to Rut'theran Village [G33.3,39.8 Darkshore]
[A Alliance] Walk up from the pier to the portal on the hill and step in [G54.8,97.2 Teldrassil][G55.2,89.2 Teldrassil]
-- 30.0,41.2 Darnassus is the portal spot (Teldrassil 23.4,55.5), the same spot the Blackfathom Deeps guide uses.
[A Alliance] In the Cenarion Enclave, Mathrengyl Bearwalker takes [QT92345 Beneath Nordrassil] and gives [QA92344 Get to the Roots of It] [G30.0,41.2 Darnassus][G39.5,41.2 Darnassus][G40.5,32.7 Darnassus][G39.5,21.8 Darnassus][G37.7,14.5 Darnassus][G35.4,8.4 Darnassus] \\ QuestieDB lists a hostile level 60 "Credit" marker nearby; it is a quest trigger, not a mob (judgement).
[A Alliance] Back through the portal and down to the pier [G30.0,41.2 Darnassus][G55.2,89.2 Teldrassil][G54.8,97.2 Teldrassil] [OC]
[A Alliance] Take the boat to Auberdine and walk to the flight master [G33.3,39.8 Darkshore][G32.7,41.9 Darkshore][G37.0,44.0 Darkshore][G36.4,45.6 Darkshore] [OC]
[A Alliance] Fly to Talrendis Point [F Talrendis Point] [G36.4,45.6 Darkshore]
[A Alliance] North-east through the hills to the Ruins of Eldarath [G11.8,78.4 Azshara][G23.7,64.9 Azshara][G33.2,50.7 Azshara][G41.5,39.6 Azshara] [OC] \\ Highborne ghosts, naga, hippogryphs and Blackmaw furbolgs (level 45-52) on the way; Varo'then's Ghost and Antilos (elite, level 48-50) are off to the side.

-- Both factions: the Ruins of Eldarath and Ursolan.
Ekkal, in the Ruins of Eldarath, gives [QA97327 Blackmaw Pouches] [G42.0,38.9 Azshara] \\ Needs level 55. QuestieDB places Blackmaw Thralls and Legashi Slayers (elite, level 55-57) in the ruins; pull with care.
Ogtinc, just south, gives [QA92069 Claws That Rend, Tusks that Gore] [G42.4,42.6 Azshara]
North along the road to Ursolan [G42.0,38.9 Azshara][G42.2,28.4 Azshara] [OC]
Lorekeeper Nok gives [QA92066 The Twin Bears] [G41.4,20.0 Azshara] \\ Needs Timbermaw Hold reputation Neutral (Dungeon Journal, QuestUpdates.lua 92066 note; not in QuestieDB or the Wowhead tooltip). QuestieDB lists Nok, Elder Bramblesnap and the Ursolan furbolgs as hostile, which our judgement (not a source) says holds only below Neutral; Blackmaw Shamans and Ursas (level 50-52) stand by the road south of the camp.
South again past Eldarath, then west to the furbolg gate [G42.2,28.4 Azshara][G42.0,38.9 Azshara][G38.6,33.2 Azshara] [OC] \\ Blackmaw Champions (elite, level 57) stand at the gate, and an elite Gatekeeper Rageroar (level 50) is listed just north of it.
Follow the tunnel to its far end and enter Blackmaw Hold [G38.6,33.2 Azshara]

-- Inside Blackmaw Hold.
[A Horde][QC92343 Get to the Roots of It] \\ Gather 10 Nordrassil Root Caps.
[A Alliance][QC92344 Get to the Roots of It] \\ Gather 10 Nordrassil Root Caps.
[A Horde][QC97198 Blackmaw Magic] \\ Find the Blackmaw Ritual Totem.
[A Alliance][QC97173 Blackmaw Magic] \\ Find the Blackmaw Ritual Totem (only if you took it in Dalaran).
[QC92066 The Twin Bears] \\ Find the Totem of Ursoc and the Totem of Ursol.
[QC92069 Claws That Rend, Tusks that Gore] \\ Withermaw and Bonesnout drop the claws and the tusks; Dungeon Journal says they sit on different paths, so clear both.
[QC97327 Blackmaw Pouches] \\ Collect 5 Blackmaw Pouches.
A Feathered Charm Necklace drops inside: right-click it to start [QA92070 A Lost Memento]

